<title>SPAIN: Spanish CPI seen climbing 1.6 y/y in June - bank.</title>
<headline>Spanish CPI seen climbing 1.6 y/y in June - bank.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish savings bank Caja de Madrid forecast on Wednesday that Spain's consumer price index would climb 0.1 percent in June and 1.6 percent on the year, compared with a 1.5 percent rise in May.</p>
<p>Core inflation, which rose 1.9 percent in May, could slow a bit in June, climbing 1.8 percent, a Caja de Madrid study said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
